@startuml
left to right direction

[*] --> Detecting
Detecting : Monitoring sensors\n(Accel/Gyro)

Detecting --> Candidate : Anomaly detected\n(Threshold exceeded)
Candidate --> Detecting : Continuing\nto detect
Candidate : Potential anomaly flagged\ninternally

Candidate --> AwaitingValidation : Trip Ended
AwaitingValidation : Presented to user\nfor confirmation

AwaitingValidation --> Validated : User confirms\nanomaly
Validated : Information stored\nas valid data

AwaitingValidation --> FalsePositive : User rejects\nanomaly
FalsePositive : Data discarded\ninternally

Validated --> Publication : Data aggregated\nto community map
Publication : Public map status\nupdated

FalsePositive --> [*]
Publication --> [*]
@enduml